LangBot integration: https://github.com/langbot-app/LangBot
The optional split-send tool includes a small adapter-call fragment adapted from
LangBot 4.11.4 (Apache-2.0). The public edition changes installation paths into
explicit operator-selected configuration and requires opt-in application.
LangBot itself and its dependencies are installed separately, not bundled.

